// all: `(0, upper)`, its source's upper bound, as `Filter`, `FilterMap`,
// `SkipWhile`, `TakeWhile`, `MapWhile` and `Scan` give it (filter.rs:118,
// filter_map.rs:126, skip_while.rs:65, take_while.rs:59, map_while.rs:49,
// scan.rs:51).
